{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03731","headline":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方总管张仁亶 · 李峤","name":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方总管张仁亶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉塞征骄子，金符命老臣。\n三军张武斾，万乘饯行轮。\n猛气凌玄朔，崇恩降紫宸。\n投醪还结士，辞第本忘身。\n露下鹰初击，风高雁欲宾。\n方销塞北祲，还靖漠南尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}